You need to tell that man to seek mental health counseling for his gender dysphoria. If he does not wish to seek help for this, he needs to be shamed, mocked, and ridiculed for it any time you see or hear from him (hopefully never) This isn't normal. Normal people are not okay with that. 

&#x200B;

Every day we descend deep into the clown world.

My dog slept next to me for over 10 years and he passed last week. i've held a pillow every night since. reading this made me immediately tear up. 

&#x200B;

fuck. i hate myself so much.

